{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00673","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 象德舞 · 段文昌","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 象德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃清庙，登显至德。\n泽周八荒，兵定四极。\n生物咸遂，羣盗灭息。\n明圣钦承，子孙千亿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段文昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}